<title>DENMARK: Danish KommuneKredit raises amount on 4-pct bond.</title>
<headline>Danish KommuneKredit raises amount on 4-pct bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish KommuneKredit raised an existing four-percent bond due 2002 by 103.6 million crowns to 1.252.425 billion crowns, arranger Gudme Raaschou said in a statement distributed by Copenhagen Stock Exchange on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said the bonds were already sold.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
